TALL_PREFIX=/usr -DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib\n```\nWhere files get installed: `/usr` as root prefix, libraries in `/usr/lib`.\n\n## Compiler Selection\n\n```bash\n-DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=icx -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=icpx\n```\nUse Intel's **icx** (C) and **icpx** (C++/SYCL) compilers instead of GCC. This is the core of"}